<title>BELGIUM: Belgian railways to invest 37.1 bln Bfr in 1997.</title>
<headline>Belgian railways to invest 37.1 bln Bfr in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian state railway company NMBS-SNCB said that its board approved a 1997 investment budget of 37.1 billion francs on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;This amounts comprises both classic investments (23.8 billion) as those for the (high-speed train network) HST (13.3 billion),&quot; NMBS said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
